# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo

# MSIX / UWP packaging output. `AppPackages/` holds the produced .msix and
# its signing sidecars, and `BundleArtifacts/` the intermediate bundle
# manifests -- both are build artefacts, and neither is reproducible input.
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.msixupload

# Signing material. A code-signing certificate or private key must never be
# committed -- CI restores one from a base64 secret (see AGENTS.md and the
# android-ci.yml precedent). The temporary certificate Visual Studio
# generates for a new UWP project is caught by the same rule.
*.pfx
*.cer
*.snk
*_TemporaryKey.pfx

# The generated web payload staged into the package by the build. Its
# canonical source is the shared client workspace, not this directory.
src/Playarr.Xbox/WebPayload/
